# Git tracks each variant's DVC pointer, <operation>/<arch>/<variant>.tar.gz.dvc.
# dvc pull fetches the archive beside it, and reference_common/artifact.py unpack
# extracts it into the source default, <operation>/<arch>/<variant>/. This file
# already ignores every archive, so dvc add writes no .gitignore of its own.
/*/*/*.tar.gz
/*/*/*/
# Leftovers of the earlier per-architecture layout: <operation>/<arch>.tar.gz
# archives and bundles extracted into <operation>/<arch>/.
/*/*.tar.gz
/*/*/*.json
